                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 or 8<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Quad Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Any powerful AMD/ATI or NVIDIA card with more than 512 of RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 1 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Anything that goes beyond bleep really<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> More fun with a pad though you can use your keyboard</li></ul>"
